     "text": "I’ll check the mix-input conventions, then predict both properties and retrieve published analogue mixes where needed.\n| Property | Prediction: q50 [q10, q90] |\n|---|---:|\n| Static yield stress | **855 [66.9, 5,016] Pa** |\n| Plastic viscosity | **7.11 [0.890, 27.1] Pa·s** |\n\nBrackets show the **80% prediction interval**. Both use the general models selected automatically; neither was flagged weak or outside the training range.\n\nAssumptions: natural sand; admixture percentages are product mass relative to binder; static yield stress at **0 s rest**. The tool also retained defaults of 28 d, comp_cube50 and moist curing at 20 °C/RH 95%; these are not fresh-rheology test specifications.\n\nThe broad intervals warrant experimental verification; these predictions alone do not establish printability.\n\nFiles: [Prediction CSV](<C:/Users/User/3D Printing Concrete Prediction/artifacts/reports/agent/20261016-165627-d7ac/predictions_agent_mix.csv>) · [Figure](<C:/Users/User/3D Printing Concrete Prediction/artifacts/reports/agent/20261016-165627-d7ac/predictions_agent_mix.png>) · [Mix specification](<C:/Users/User/3D Printing Concrete Prediction/artifacts/reports/agent/20261016-165627-d7ac/mix_agent_mix.json>)\n",
